10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,630
Mountain runner enters the mountain

11
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,750
There is no rule about returning empty-handed.

12
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:27,780
Find a way to survive

13
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,380
What can you achieve by cutting an egg with two stones?

14
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:34,530
Look carefully at your eyes again

15
